  "description": "Add a warm, cute, and festive touch to your holiday projects with this Christmas Teddy Bear Clipart Bundle! 🎅🧸\nThis adorable collection includes 12 unique Christmas-themed teddy bear clipart designs, featuring charming holiday elements and cozy seasonal details. These versatile PNG graphics are perfect for creating eye-catching Christmas crafts, printables, invitations, apparel, stickers, sublimation projects, greeting cards, scrapbooking, party decorations, digital products, and more. 🎁✨\n📦 Bundle Includes:\n🧸 12 Unique Christmas Teddy Bear Clipart PNG Files\n📐 Size: 4800 × 4800 px\n🖨️ Resolution: 300 DPI\n💻 High-Quality PNG Files\n🔄 Designs Are Resizable\n🎨 Perfect for Personal & Creative Projects\n🎄 Perfect For:\nT-Shirts, Sublimation, DTF Printing, Stickers, Mugs, Tumblers, Greeting Cards, Invitations, Scrapbooking, Planner Designs, Party Decorations, Christmas Crafts, Printable Projects, Digital Designs, POD Products, and more.\n✨ These high-resolution Christmas teddy bear graphics are designed to provide flexibility and quality for both digital and print projects. Create adorable holiday products and festive artwork with this versatile clipart collection!\nPlease check the included file specifications and your intended software compatibility before purchasing.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a warm, cute, and festive touch to your holiday projects with this Christmas Teddy Bear Clipart Bundle! 🎅🧸</p>\n<p>This adorable collection includes 12 unique Christmas-themed teddy bear clipart designs, featuring charming holiday elements and cozy seasonal details. These versatile PNG graphics are perfect for creating eye-catching Christmas crafts, printables, invitations, apparel, stickers, sublimation projects, greeting cards, scrapbooking, party decorations, digital products, and more. 🎁✨</p>\n<p>📦 Bundle Includes:<br>\n🧸 12 Unique Christmas Teddy Bear Clipart PNG Files<br>\n📐 Size: 4800 × 4800 px<br>\n🖨️ Resolution: 300 DPI<br>\n💻 High-Quality PNG Files<br>\n🔄 Designs Are Resizable<br>\n🎨 Perfect for Personal &amp; Creative Projects</p>\n<p>🎄 Perfect For:<br>\nT-Shirts, Sublimation, DTF Printing, Stickers, Mugs, Tumblers, Greeting Cards, Invitations, Scrapbooking, Planner Designs, Party Decorations, Christmas Crafts, Printable Projects, Digital Designs, POD Products, and more.</p>\n<p>✨ These high-resolution Christmas teddy bear graphics are designed to provide flexibility and quality for both digital and print projects. Create adorable holiday products and festive artwork with this versatile clipart collection!</p>\n<p>Please check the included file specifications and your intended software compatibility before purchasing.</p>",
